    reading: "Revenue concentration measures how much of the business's income depends on a small number of relationships. Above 40% top-three concentration, the loss of a single customer becomes a potentially existential event. Context matters: 45% concentration behind long-term contracts with high switching costs is a different risk from 45% concentration behind easily-cancelled relationships.",
